      "title": "Shop Local at the Makers&#8217; Market",
      "description": "<p>The holidays are just around the corner, and we&#8217;ve got the perfect place to find one-of-a-kind gifts! Join the Hurt Hub on Friday<b>, November 13 from 4:00-7:00pm</b> for our Makers&#8217; Market, co-hosted with the Van Every/Smith Galleries at Davidson College.</p>\n<p>Discover local artisans showcasing their handcrafted goods throughout the Hurt Hub. Browse stunning pottery, artisan jewelry, small-batch jams and sauces, original prints, and so much more.</p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re shopping for loved ones or treating yourself (we won&#8217;t tell!), you&#8217;ll find something truly special while supporting local creators.</p>",
