      "url": "https://hurthub.davidson.edu/event/the-hurt-hub-innovation-entrepreneurship-showcase/",
      "rest_url": "https://hurthub.davidson.edu/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/6357",
      "title": "The Hurt Hub Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurship Showcase",
      "description": "<div>The Hurt Hub Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurship Showcase celebrates the inspiring work of individuals and teams connected through the Hurt Hub.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px\">\n<div style=\"margin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left\">\n<p>The third annual Hurt Hub Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurship Showcase brings together student visionaries, emerging community ventures, and entrepreneurship advocates to highlight the work happening through the Hurt Hub at Davidson College. Whether you&#8217;re an aspiring entrepreneur, a seasoned business leader, or simply curious about innovation, we invite you to join us on Wednesday, November 18, 2026 from 6-9pm.</p>\n<h4><strong><strong>Event Highlights:</strong></strong></h4>\n<p><strong><strong>Idea Sprint Competition</strong></strong></p>\n<p>Experience the Davidson Entrepreneurship Club&#8217;s signature Idea Sprint competition in a lively, expo-style showcase. Student teams staff booths throughout the Hurt Hub’s Innovation Lab, presenting business concepts they rapidly developed over the course of a month. Attendees circulate through the expo, engaging directly with teams before casting a vote for their favorite. Audience choice determines the winning concept!</p>\n<p><strong><strong>The Hurt Hub Program Expo featuring entrepreneurs from</strong></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Student Try It Fund</li>\n<li>Yoder Applied Research Fellowship</li>\n<li>Building a Lean Startup</li>\n<li>LaunchCLT’s CO.STARTERS</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><strong>Awards Presentation</strong></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Avinger Impact Fund Finalists &amp; Awards</li>\n<li>Small Business Community Impact Fund Awards powered by the Duke  Energy Foundation</li>\n<li>FACES of Innovation Award</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><strong>Agenda</strong></strong></p>\n<p>6:00-7:15: IdeaSprint Voting, Networking, Entrepreneur Expo</p>\n<p>7:15-8:00: Awards Presentations</p>\n<p>8:00-9:00: Open Networking</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
