      "url": "https://hurthub.davidson.edu/event/cpa-office-hours-schwinn-cpa-pllc-2/",
      "rest_url": "https://hurthub.davidson.edu/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/5477",
      "title": "CPA Office Hours (SCHWINN CPA PLLC)",
      "description": "<p>The Hurt Hub has partnered with Bob Schwinn of SCHWINN CPA PLLC to offer free 30 minute consultations for small businesses and entrepreneurs. The Schwinn CPA firm specializes in serving small businesses and will be hosting virtual office hours to answer your questions around topics such as:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>How to Set up a New Business</li>\n<li>Year-end planning for a business</li>\n<li>Basic budgeting/forecasting concepts</li>\n<li>What kinds of financial reports a small business owner should review</li>\n<li>Setting up books for a business &amp; types of accounting software</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To set up a virtual appointment, please use this <a href=\"https://calendly.com/schwinncpa/30min\">calendly link</a>. Once you click to confirm your appointment on calendly, please share a little bit about what you are looking to discuss during the meeting and what stage you’re at in your business.</p>\n<p><i>The Hurt Hub is pleased to connect our small business community with this free resource. All consultations are undertaken at the participant&#8217;s own risk and discretion; the Hurt Hub is not responsible for outcomes of individual sessions.</i></p>",
