      "url": "https://hurthub.davidson.edu/event/solopreneur-circle-4/",
      "rest_url": "https://hurthub.davidson.edu/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/6475",
      "title": "Solopreneur Circle",
      "description": "<div>A monthly community gathering for entrepreneurs to celebrate wins, work through challenges, and discover resources.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px\">\n<div style=\"margin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left\">\n<p>Each month we welcome entrepreneurs to join us at the Hurt Hub for a community gathering called the Solopreneur Circle.</p>\n<p>Facilitated by Michelle McKown-Campbell, this intimate space brings together solo entrepreneurs to celebrate wins, work through challenges, and discover resources with people who are on similar paths.</p>\n<p>Coffee, community, and conversations that matter. Your seat at the table is waiting.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><em><em>The Hurt Hub welcomes requests for reasonable accommodations related to disability and will strive to make this program accessible to participants. Please contact our team at the Hurt Hub at hurthub@davidson.edu</em></em><em><em> </em></em><em><em>to make such a request.</em></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
